  "goodToKnow": "Das Krafttraining is strength or weight training: im Fitnessstudio Krafttraining machen, mit Hanteln (dumbbells) or Geräten (machines). It contrasts with Ausdauertraining (endurance training). Die Kraft means strength or force, as in Kraftwerk (power station). Colloquially, people say pumpen gehen. Muskelkater is the soreness afterwards. It has no plural."
